 humidifier in centrally heated or air-conditioned rooms"}]]}],["$","li","Position your screen below eye level so your eyes are slightly closed, reducing tear evaporation",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-700","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-[var(--color-success)] shrink-0 mt-0.5","fill":"currentColor","viewBox":"0 0 20 20","children":["$","path",null,{"fillRule":"evenodd","d":"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z","clipRule":"evenodd"}]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Position your screen below eye level so your eyes are slightly closed, reducing tear evaporation"}]]}],["$","li","Maintain good eyelid hygiene with daily warm compresses if prone to MGD or blepharitis",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-700","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-[var(--color-success)] shrink-0 mt-0.5","fill":"currentColor","viewBox":"0 0 20 20","children":["$","path",null,{"fillRule":"evenodd","d":"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z","clipRule":"evenodd"}]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Maintain good eyelid hygiene with daily warm compresses if prone to MGD or blepharitis"}]]}],["$","li","Stay well hydrated throughout the day",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-700","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-[var(--color-success)] shrink-0 mt-0.5","fill":"currentColor","viewBox":"0 0 20 20","children":["$","path",null,{"fillRule":"evenodd","d":"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z","clipRule":"evenodd"}]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Stay well hydrated throughout the day"}]]}],["$","li","Wear wraparound sunglasses or glasses in windy conditions",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-700","children":["$L25","$L26"]}],"$L27"]}]]}]
